Tf9wSzJYRyJA","name":"Starbucks","shared_categories":"","shared_category_count":0}],"text":[{"business_id":"t3OnkntIrz2GjYgeGmsh5Q","review_id":"MZFQetCC4-iDJx-BRpGcYA","date":"2018-09-16T21:30:28","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9321047067642212,"text_excerpt":"The food was good. We went during happy hour and we got 2 for 1 for oyster! And the $3 beer and wine. It was great! The charcoal oyster was amazing! Loved it so much the garlic sauce and the garlic break was just such a great combination with the Oyster. Can't stress how good it was! We also got the shrimp po boy and it was good but not as good as the oyster dish. Overall we had a great experience and I would go back for the oysters on happy hour."},{"business_id":"t3OnkntIrz2GjYgeGmsh5Q","review_id":"_uvWUYRBEtYYpOTQfeZzvg","date":"2018-09-26T20:41:43","stars":5,"text_representativeness":0.9318821430206299,"text_excerpt":"Amazing breakfast right down the street from our hotel. We had the crawfish and egg beignets......awesome. Plus they have a happy house with BOGO oysters, heading over now! Ok, now I have to add that we just went there for happy hour. We had the grilled oysters......do I hear harps? Because the oysters were flipping heavenly! PJ shucked our fresh oysters, which we had first, and he was a primo shucker. The raw oysters were great but the grilled ones were from another dimension! Great place for cheap happy hour drinks and oysters. Great wait staff and PJ was awesome and a great shucking entertainer!"},{"business_id":"t3OnkntIrz2GjYgeGmsh5Q","review_id":"XSRAeX82Qjg67CcVSpKFFg","date":"2019-04-23T01:42:31","stars":4,"text_representativeness":0.9294481873512268,"text_excerpt":"Great bunch spot. We went on a Sunday. Not too busy but we made a reservation just in case. We had the charbroiled oysters (amazing), crawfish and egg beignet, breakfast beignet sandwich, and breakfast burger. Everyone enjoyed their breakfast. Mine had some plastic in it... bright blue. Not sure what from. We had beignets for dessert- no Cafe Du Monde but still really good. TackleBox Bloody Mary was just okay. Service was pretty good- nothing above and beyond."}],"visual":[{"business_id":"t3OnkntIrz2GjYgeGmsh5Q","photo_id":"ibVGiJfr9EeJZCEjMuiegA","label":"inside","image_url":"/photos/ibVGiJfr9EeJZCEjMuiegA.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8976991176605225},{"business_id":"t3OnkntIrz2GjYgeGmsh5Q","photo_id":"9Yws-eVWGk0HRCveLT5RvQ","label":"food","image_url":"/photos/9Yws-eVWGk0HRCveLT5RvQ.jpg","visual_representativeness":0.8976991176605225}]},"notebook_case":null}
